```{list-table} Monitoring
:name: Monitoring_Monitoring
:header-rows: 1
:width: 100%
:widths: 25 15 10 50

* - Attribute
  - Type
  - {abbr}`m (multiplicity)`
  - Definition

* - euMonitoringSiteCode  
  - {term}`wiseIdentifier`
  - [1]
  - Unique European identifier of the monitoring site

* - parameterCode 
  - {term}`Parameter`
  - [1]
  - The biological quality elements, hydromorphological quality element,
    physico-chemical parameter, chemical substance or parameter 
    observed at the monitoring site.

* - chemicalMatrix    
  - {term}`ChemicalMatrixType`
  - [0..3]
  - For chemical substances, report the matrix or matrices 
    in which the substance is monitored. 
    Report if an only if the parameter monitored is a chemical substance.

* - chemicalPurpose   
  - {term}`ChemicalPurpose`  
  - [0..2]  
  - For chemical substances, report the purpose(s) 
    for which the substance is monitored. 
    Report if an only if the parameter monitored is a chemical substance.

* - frequency      
  - {term}`MonitoringFrequency`
  - [1]
  - Report the frequency at which the parameter is monitored at this site.

* - cycle   
  - {term}`MonitoringCycle`
  - [1]       
  - Report the monitoring cycle for the parameter at this site.

* - lastMonitored 
  - {term}`gYear` 
  - [1]
  - Report the most recent year when the parameter was monitored at this site,
    in the format YYYY. Enter 9999 if the parameter is yet to be measured.

```
